.TH "BANDE-MEDIA-ENGINE" "1" "" "bande-player" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
bande\-media\-engine \- decode audio and video for Player and Glance
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B bande\-media\-engine
.SH DESCRIPTION
The separate process in which Player and Glance decode and play media with
GStreamer. They start it with a socket on its standard input and send it their
commands there; it is not meant to be run by hand.
